# .cursorrules — D7460N/starter

Cursor entry point. It holds **no rules of its own** — by design.

- **Canonical laws (all AI vendors, all projects):** `D7460N-ai/D7460N.ai` → [`AGENTS.md`](https://github.com/D7460N-ai/D7460N.ai/blob/main/AGENTS.md)
  and [`.agents/skills/`](https://github.com/D7460N-ai/D7460N.ai/tree/main/.agents/skills) (local clone: `~/D7460N.ai`). Read and follow them before every response.
- **This repo's project-specific rules:** [`AGENTS.md`](./AGENTS.md)

Never restate canonical rules here. Edit them in `D7460N-ai/D7460N.ai`; every project follows.
